# Nothing that looks like Periscope session output may be committed from the
# test tree, whatever it is called.
#
# The session base directory is chosen in the session dialog and remembered in
# QSettings, so it follows wherever it was last pointed. It was once pointed at
# test/session_testing/, which accumulated ~1.1 GB of capture .h5 inside the
# test suite. That directory now lives at outputs/ (ignored in the root
# .gitignore), and this pattern is the backstop: if anyone's settings still
# resolve to somewhere under test/, the captures still cannot be committed.
#
# Session folders are named session_<YYYYmmdd>_<HHMMSS> by
# session_manager.start_session().
session_*/
